    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hine þonne werian wille oððe oðfleo, ðonne ne sparige hine mon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he [the thief] tries to defend himself, or if he takes to flight, he shall not be spared.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he hine ðanne werian wylle oððe fleo, ðanne ne sparie hine man ær ðam [oþer …..</ab>
      </div>
